          "patchedSha256": "a9493a99096da6595b8d7cdb3084a0413797d31eb04c967f85ee334e922722d4",
          "reason": "Read port values into an unsigned-long temporary before assigning one-byte status/data outputs. The original casts wrote four or eight bytes into a one-byte destination.",
          "verification": "Actual Android key input aborts in kbc_read_out_buf with stack protection; original actual-source guard-byte regression fails, corrected adjacent bytes, byte values, propagated errors and null destinations pass. Evidence build/arcade-100/c/doodle-kbc-{red,green}.log."
        }
      ]
